OL,3,AApple's new boss starts with big gamble
OL,4,Aon costly first folding iPhone
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Ternus has entered his second week
OL,7,Fas Apple's chief executive and the
OL,8,Fcompany has revealed the first major
OL,9,Fchange to the iPhone since it was
OL,10,Freleased almost 20 years ago.
OL,12,FTernus, who took on Apple's top job
OL,13,Fafter Tim Cook stepped down, was
OL,14,Fonstage on Wednesday at the company's
OL,15,Fannual product release event in front
OL,16,Fof huge images of the first foldable
OL,17,FiPhone.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
