OL,3,AApple's new boss starts with big gamble
OL,4,Aon costly first folding iPhone
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith a book-style format, the new
OL,7,FiPhone, dubbed the Duo, is the largest
OL,8,Fever size of the product. And with a US
OL,9,Fstarting price of $1,999 (#1,475) going
OL,10,Fup to $3,200, it is also the most
OL,11,Fexpensive. UK prices start at #1,999.
OL,13,FTernus said the Duo was "inspired by
OL,14,Fthe iPad" but called the folding
OL,15,Ffeatures "fluid and completely
OL,16,Fintuitive."
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
